{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e33ef9fc97fa912465bf0e639645d62f3052c1aa76f24ad671ce189326bc92fd", "ja": "（今日は、瑞希と桃子の新曲PV撮影。\n前半が無事終わり、休憩後はダンスパートからだ！）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希和桃子的歌曲PV拍摄。前半部分顺利结束，休息后要拍舞蹈部分了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "1b864f31aebdc8ab772bfc1a7d09fcaf5b88b456dab79c4808c039ecf76244a5", "ja": "見ているだけで癒される、とはこのことですね。\nかわいいな。微笑ましいな。……ほっこり。", "zh": "这就是所谓的\"光看着就心旷神怡\"吧。\n真可爱。真暖心。……好治愈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f7c16230ca1f4b050fa6dc68e7b3c91555a692a51971acae3cb32c0935341f4b", "ja": "お疲れ様、瑞希。\n何を見て……ああ。桃子と子役のひまりさんか。", "zh": "辛苦了，瑞希。\n你在看什么……啊，是桃子和童星日葵小姐啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "319d73eb8b5d6bcba07d3e21dfaab775cffac3b3662ad32d40beac0259ffc07f", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nはい。癒やしの光景を覗き見していました。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。\n是的。我刚才一直在偷看治愈的景象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "a3e7c59ae9d9faec3e18305dc757280e8293f5adf9892fd08eda4faf673242f7", "ja": "ふたりとも、お別れが寂しいみたいで。\n先程からずっと、話をしています。……時間稼ぎ。", "zh": "两个人似乎都很舍不得分别。\n从刚才开始就一直在聊天……是在拖延时间。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1005_p", "source_sha256": "435e26c45b4f50d814c04f205daf7640516f633eee5f4f56696a5b224bd85412", "ja": "なるほど。それでひまりさんのマネージャーさんが、\n心配そうに見ているのか。", "zh": "原来如此。所以，ひまり小姐的经纪人才会一脸担心地看着她们啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "84ac8e2524968187fb60f47466704e105bc7ce3125672988db6e78e7348917f2", "ja": "はい。ふたりが、とても可愛らしくて。\n思わず見入ってしまいました。", "zh": "是的。两个人都太可爱了，让我不由得看入了迷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1007_p", "source_sha256": "2942760b059450764f1f9cfc0587b3b0e3134e3e55e4916842563905bd36b04a", "ja": "そうだな。CMの時も今日も、\nふたりのことをよく見てくれて、ありがとう。", "zh": "是啊。无论是拍广告时，还是今天，都一直认真关注着她们。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "2e673e79e8d7613032abd854a24261531fde23ce6516b444f80f2fb04a8a9b90", "ja": "お役に立ててよかったです。劇場には、\n年下の子が多いですから。お姉さんはお手のものです。", "zh": "能帮上忙就好。剧场里有很多比我年纪小的孩子。照顾妹妹可是我的拿手好戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1009_p", "source_sha256": "95dac9dddd8c9191b0b547d85620288eb417c85c074a1cf5fb2a72a5f6108044", "ja": "それなら……瑞希お姉さんに、\nひとつお願いがあるんだけど。", "zh": "既然这样……瑞希姐姐，我有一件事想拜托你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "79814b85c78df804213123636c483a6e3822fa113910bf91a500b21e05ff8aa7", "ja": "なんと。瑞希お姉さん。\n……{$P$}も、甘えたいのですか。", "zh": "什么。瑞希姐姐。\n……{$P$}也想撒娇了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1011_p", "source_sha256": "cefc06f022f214d521b6337a4548824b629e33d97b7b2bc57765d17d6cecac93", "ja": "いや、そうじゃなくて……。\nそろそろ、桃子たちを止めてほしいかなって。", "zh": "不，不是那样……\n我是希望差不多该去制止桃子她们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1012_p", "source_sha256": "23750b8bd85040842dc285e1c6c54dd4cbd5517f30433ab65f5f069cdb14ff5d", "ja": "マネージャーさんも、時間を気にしているみたいだし。\n名残惜しいけど、そろそろな。", "zh": "经理好像也在留意时间。  \n虽然有些舍不得，但也差不多该停下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "8f1f11472d0d2c440ee1b7e66c7d8f9ca98609a07a78593c047af4d2697c5068", "ja": "わかりました。お姉さんとして、\n{$P$}のお願いを聞きましょう。", "zh": "我知道了。作为姐姐，\n就听听{$P$}的愿望吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0383_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0383_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "c89da05d79372a06279bf5df42da24eacba0f35c1f146541bfca5b65f128efc2", "ja": "それでは、いってきます。\n……お姉さん。がんばるぞ。", "zh": "那么，我出发了。\n……姐姐。我会加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
